Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Torrents of bitter rain lash against the towering stone peaks of Mount Myoboku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Young ninja Naruto Uzumaki sits motionless atop a massive, weathered toad statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.35,0:00:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wild natural energy swirls invisibly through the thick, damp mountain atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep orange pigmentation suddenly erupts around his fierce, determined blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A violent surge of primal chakra threatens to consume his human soul entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wise master Fukasaku watches closely from a nearby mossy stone outcrop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolute stillness must conquer the chaotic storm raging deep within his spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The tumultuous downpour parts as powerful sacred energy finally aligns within him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant horizontal yellow iris markings reveal the ultimate mastery of sage jutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He stands triumphant as the true legendary successor of Mount Myoboku.
